OL,3,ABurnham tells MPs a new EU deal could
OL,4,Aboost growth and help tackle illegal
OL,5,Aimmigration
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch says
OL,8,Fthe PM is "not going to get a better
OL,9,Fdeal" as the EU "are tough negotiators"
OL,11,FOn Sunday, Burnham told a podcast it
OL,12,Fwas "clear" Russia had interfered in
OL,13,Fthe Brexit vote. Badenoch and Lib Dem
OL,14,Fleader Ed Davey called on Burnham to
OL,15,Fshare the evidence, while Reform leader
OL,16,FNigel Farage branded the PM "a liar"
OL,18,FIn his statement, Burnham condemned
OL,19,FRussian strikes on Ukraine, saying he
OL,20,Fwelcomes President Trump's announcement
OL,21,Fof an "energy ceasefire"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
